# Mouse Cocaine Self-Administration Withdrawal DTI

This dataset contains diffusion MRI data acquired from mice following cocaine or saline self-administration.

The dataset includes four subjects:
- Two cocaine self-administration animals
- Two saline self-administration animals

Only the withdrawal imaging time point is included in this dataset.

Diffusion MRI was acquired on a 7 Tesla Bruker MRI system at Michigan State University.

Files are organized according to the Brain Imaging Data Structure (BIDS).
